Copyright 2026 Synergy Labs (챗대리) and the 마브 contributors

마브 is a fork of Baalda (https://github.com/naveedharri/baalda), modified by
Synergy Labs: Korean localisation, HWP/HWPX and PPTX support, a self-hosted-only
server setup and other changes. It is not the official Baalda project and is not
endorsed by it. The original Baalda notice follows unchanged.

